Formulas
□ mrr() — MRR with lifetime amortization
□ arr() — annualized
□ arpu() — average revenue per user
□ gross_margin() — net revenue − COGS
□ revenue_churn() — churned MRR ÷ starting MRR
□ customer_churn() — churned customers ÷ starting
□ ltv_simple() — ARPU ÷ churn
□ ltv_real() — LTV × gross margin
□ cac() — acquisition spend ÷ new customers
