K. Rules (Never Break)
□ Zero runtime dependencies in core
□ Money is Decimal, never float
□ No print() / input() in core
□ All formulas have tests
□ Business logic never in CLI or GUI
□ MIT license stays MIT
□ CLI stays free forever
□ Never break the public API without a major version bump
That's the whole map. Every checkbox is a real task. Tick them one at a time.

